
  syslog-ng log collector - read-only log access

  Logs:   /var/log/remote/<host>/<YYYY-MM-DD_HH>.log   (older hours: .log.gz)

  lnav -r /var/log/remote                  browse all senders, merged by time
  lnav /var/log/remote/<host>              one sender (.gz files included)
  rg -z 'pattern' /var/log/remote          search everything, incl. .gz
  rg -z -i 'error' /var/log/remote/<host>  case-insensitive, one sender

  lnav: '/' search, 'q' quit, ':filter-in <regex>', 'e'/'E' next/prev error

